OL,3,GNEWSADerek the Dinosaur to mark
OL,4,Amilestone with makeover
OL,5,
OL,6,FA concrete dinosaur which has sat at
OL,7,Fthe centre of a playground for almost
OL,8,Fhalf a century is to get a
OL,9,F"much-needed" makeover.
OL,11,FKnown as Derek, the dinosaur has been
OL,12,Fenjoyed by generations of children
OL,13,Fsince he was installed in 1977 at South
OL,14,FStreet Recreation Ground in South
OL,15,FNormanton, Derbyshire.
OL,17,FDerek was one of the first projects of
OL,18,FJunction Arts, which is itself
OL,19,Fcelebrating its 50th anniversary this
OL,20,Fyear, and the charity has launched an
OL,21,Fappeal to restore the reptile as well
OL,22,Fas tell his story.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
